WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,960
This is my natal spiritual animal Wu Gouhu

2
00:00:01,960 --> 00:00:03,440
I named her Xue Wu

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,970
Wow so cute

4
00:00:06,970 --> 00:00:13,150
It’s a pity that although Wu Gouhu cherishes it

5
00:00:13,150 --> 00:00:14,350
The combat power is not high

6
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:16,950
And she’s also a first-level tiger-baiting senior sister.

7
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:19,390
I am confident that she will be promoted to level two within three days.

8
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:22,420
Junior brother, you were also born as a cow, Di is not afraid of tigers

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:25,220
Even if I cultivated from the first level to the second level

10
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,420
It took more than half a year.

11
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,180
I know you want to comfort your sister

12
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:32,020
But to practice, you still need to suppress your junior fellow apprentices.

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,030
This is the sect’s spiritual practice

14
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:36,470
There is also a second-level spirit path that I trained.

15
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,230
I'll see you as a chess piece for now

16
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:39,510
Don’t understand the cultivation methods

17
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:41,150
You can go to the sect to take a big class

18
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,810
You can also ask me

19
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:44,370
I want to tell you about the duel first

20
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,230
Just report it to the master

21
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:47,790
Thank you, senior sister

22
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:49,310
After all, you are implicated by me

23
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:50,750
This will make Wang Zhi unhappy

24
00:00:50,750 --> 00:00:52,230
There is no need to rush into cultivation matters

25
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:53,750
Just do your best

26
00:00:53,750 --> 00:00:54,990
Senior sister will take care of everything for you
